## Phase 1: Schedule Search (forall + tile_K + tile_reg + vectorize + unroll)
## Applying best schedule from matmul_256_512_1024 as starting point


## Candidate 1: forall[4,8] + K[64] + [4,8,16] + vectorize + unroll_K×4
- Time: 2.110 ms | Speedup vs baseline: 164x

## Candidate 2: forall[8,4] + K[64] + [4,8,16] + vectorize + unroll_K×4
- Time: 1.884 ms | Better than C1 (M-heavier)

## Candidate 3: forall[4,4] + K[64] + [4,8,16] + vectorize + unroll_K×4
- Time: 1.574 ms | *** BEST SO FAR ***
- Key: Square 512×512 benefits from fewer, larger tiles (16 threads, M=128/N=128 per thread)
- Per-thread working set: ~256KB ≈ L2 boundary → good cache behavior

