## Phase 2: K tile size exploration (on top of forall[4,4])


## Candidate 4: forall[4,4] + K[32] + [4,8,16] + vectorize + unroll_K×2
- Time: 1.504 ms | *** NEW BEST ***
- K=32 → A_tile=128×32=32KB, B_tile=32×128=32KB → BOTH FIT IN L1!

## Candidate 5: forall[4,4] + K[128] + [4,8,16] + vectorize + unroll_K×8
- Time: 2.393 ms | WORSE (code bloat + register pressure from 8× unroll)

### K tile summary: K=32 optimal (L1-fitting tiles), K=64 close, K=128 much worse

